    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-m/q11-question-1.svg\" alt=\"A function f  is defined in a restricted real domain and has equation ( ) ≡ 2 − + f x x 6 x 13 . It is further given that the equations f x = ( ) 8 , f x = ( ) 13 and f x = ( ) 20 have 2 distinct solutions, 1 solution and no solutions, respectively. Determine the possible domain of f . ( ) 6\" style=\"--madas-width:600.0px\"></figure>",
